001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.     TTAPRLSE.
001300 AUTHOR.         BK DISMUKES.
001400 INSTALLATION.   GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER COMPANY.
001500 DATE-WRITTEN.   NOVEMBER 30, 1993.
001600 DATE-COMPILED.
001700 SECURITY.
001800*REMARKS.
001900**********************************************************
002000*                  T T A P R L S E                       *
002100*           UPDATE AKRON WHEN PLANT INSTALLS TAPE        *
002200*  THIS PROGRAM WILL UPDATE MPLTINFO ENTRY "TAPE" WITH   *
002300*  THE CURRENT RELEASE OF THE CSIS/MMIS UPDATE TAPE WHEN *
002400*  THE PLANT INSTALLS THEIR TAPE.  A TRANSACTION 500     *
002500*  WILL ALSO BE CUT TO INFORM AKRON PROGRAMMING STAFF.   *
      *                                                        *
      *  USER MUST ENTER RELEASE NAME AS A PARM DURING CALL    *
002600**********************************************************
002700 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002800 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002900 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    AS-400.
003000 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    AS-400.
003100 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
            SELECT MPLTINFO-I-O
                   ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                   ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                   ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                   RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

003200 DATA DIVISION.
003300 FILE SECTION.
       FD  MPLTINFO-I-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-I-O-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500 OF MCFLCS0501.
003400
003600 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
004030 01  OPERATING-SYSTEM        PIC X(6)  VALUE SPACES.
004100
004030 01  FILE-STATUS             PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
004020
004200 COPY TDATECHK OF COPYLIB.
004500 COPY TBLOWUP OF COPYLIB.
005400*************************************************************
005500*                D A T A B A S E   V A R I A B L E S        *
005600*************************************************************
005700 COPY DATAB OF COPYLIB.
005800*----------  DATASET NAMES
005900 01  DSET-NAMES.
006000     05  DSET-NAME                PIC X(16) VALUE SPACES.
006100     05  MPLTINFO                 PIC X(16) VALUE "MPLTINFO;".
006200 01  MPLTINFO-ARG                 PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
006500 01  ALL-ITEMS                    PIC X(2)  VALUE "@;".
       COPY MPLT0    IN COPYLIB.
006600 COPY MPLTTAPE OF COPYLIB.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
003900 01  ACCEPT-DATA1.
004000     05  ACCEPT-RLSE          PIC X(6).
004010*    05  FILLER               PIC X(74) VALUE SPACES.
004020
006700**************************************************************
006800*        P R O C E D U R E        D I V I S I O N            *
006900**************************************************************
007000 PROCEDURE DIVISION   USING ACCEPT-DATA1.
007100 00-MAIN.
007200     PERFORM 010-OPEN-ALL THRU 019-EXIT.
007600
007700     PERFORM 100-UPDATE-MPLTINFO THRU 199-EXIT.
007800     CLOSE MPLTINFO-I-O.
007900     PERFORM 200-CUT-TC          THRU 299-EXIT.
008000     GOBACK.
008100****************************************************************
008200*           OPEN ALL FILES AND PREPARE FOR PROCESSING          *
008300****************************************************************
008400 010-OPEN-ALL.
008700*----------  OPEN DATABASE
           OPEN  I-O   MPLTINFO-I-O.
009200
009300 019-EXIT.  EXIT.
009400
009410*-----------  UPDATE MPLTINFO KEY='TAPE' WITH THE NEW TAPE
009420*             RELEASE NUMBER AND THE TAPE INSTALLED DATE
009500 100-UPDATE-MPLTINFO.
009600     MOVE 1 TO DATE-MODE.
009700     CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
009800     MOVE "TAPE" TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-I-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-I-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
010100     IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
010101        MOVE SPACES      TO BUF-MPLTINFO
010110        MOVE "TAPE"      TO MPLTINFO-KEY
010200        MOVE ACCEPT-RLSE TO MPLTINFO-TAPE-RLSE
010300        MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT TO MPLTINFO-TAPE-INSTALLED
              WRITE MPLTINFO-I-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                  INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
              END-WRITE
010700     ELSE
010800        MOVE ACCEPT-RLSE TO MPLTINFO-TAPE-RLSE
010900        MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT TO MPLTINFO-TAPE-INSTALLED
              REWRITE MPLTINFO-I-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                  INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
              END-REWRITE
           END-IF.

011300     IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
011400        PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
011410
011500 199-EXIT.  EXIT.
011510
011520*----------  CREATE A TC 500 BLOWUP MESSAGE TO INFORM AKRON
011530*            THAT TAPE HAS BEEN INSTALLED
011600 200-CUT-TC.
011601*----------  CALL PROGRAM TO RETRIEVE OPERATING SYSTEM
011602*    CALL "SMPEVERS" USING OPERATING-SYSTEM.
011603
011604*----------  CREATE A TRANSACTION WITH TAPE INFO
011610     MOVE "!!! TAPE WAS INSTALLED !!!" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG.
011700     MOVE ACCEPT-RLSE          TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
011800     MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT         TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2).
011900     MOVE OPERATING-SYSTEM     TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3).
012100     PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
012200 299-EXIT.  EXIT.
012300************************************************************
012400*                    B L O W U P                           *
012500*     CHECK FOR IMAGE, VIEW, OR SPOOL ERROR.  CLOSE        *
012600*     FILES, GET OUT OF BLOCK MODE, AND DISPLAY            *
012700*     APPROPRIATE ERROR MESSAGE ON SCREEN.                 *
012800*                                                          *
012900*     ALSO APPENDS THE ERROR MESSAGE TO A FILE CALLED      *
013000*     BLOWUP.PUB.  TO READ THIS FILE, RUN "XBLPRT.OBJECT". *
013100*                                                          *
013200*         !!!  PROGRAM IS ABORTED IN TBLOWUP  !!!          *
013300************************************************************
013400 990-BLOWUP.
013500*----------  PURGE THE FILE
013600     MOVE "TTAPRLSE" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
013700     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
013800           DUMMY-VIEW-AREA, DUMMY-KSAM-STAT, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
013900           BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
014000 999-EXIT.  EXIT.
